warning: on gcp: worker reads a queue but can scale to zero, and Cloud Run starts instances only for requests, so messages would wait
 --> queues.clowd:8:3
  |
8 |   scale 0 to 3
  |   ^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: scale it from at least 1, such as `scale 1 to 3`

